{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object. Take it. Move to destination. Check its properties in order to complete specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanObject    /> <Action ID = CheckProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    />",
